## Whitelist-style monorepo ignore.
## Ignore by default, then allow repository-owned paths explicitly.

# 1. Ignore everything.
*

# 2. Allow repository-owned files and directories.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!.vscode/
!.vscode/tasks.json
!backend/
!backend/**
!deployment/
!deployment/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# 3. Block generated, local, secret, and runtime artifacts.
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/.cache/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/coverage/
docs/
*.db
*.log
*.pid
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.env
.env.*
*.egg-info/
**/build/
workspace/
